version 0.9.2
symbol dc-dc-soic8

description 8-pin step-down converter with exposed pad in SOIC-8
tags buck dc-dc regulator
# Placement rules: 4/5 on the left, 1/2/3/8 on the right, 7 on top, 6/9 on bottom; pin connection points sit 2.5 outside the body edge.
# Same-side pins follow natural pin-number order: right side bottom to top 1, 2, 3, 8; left side bottom to top 4, 5; bottom side left to right 6, 9.
# Body width is 25 mm to leave clearance for long pin names like VSENSE and for the vertical pin names of GND/PAD below.
# Pin connection points sit on the 0.5 mm placement lattice (ADR-0057) in both coordinates; rows are 2.5 mm apart (ADR-0058).
